{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1149600-storyteller\u2019s-guide-shards","id":1149600,"title":"Storyteller\u2019s Guide: Shards","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-10-13T22:07:05-07:00","id":1149600,"title":"Storyteller\u2019s Guide: Shards","content":"The Demon STG is one of the finest books to release in the last few years, and part of why I adored it so much was the setting Shards in the back. I know the book for Beast is a decent ways out still, but is there any chance we\u2019ll see more of these? What Sharda would you like to see?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-14T10:39:00-07:00","id":1149729,"title":"","content":"I'm not quite sure what form it would take, but a Silver Screen style Shard for Beast would be pretty cool. Playing up classic monster movie tropes but from the monster's perspective. Maybe some mechanical flairs to help capture the feeling of those old movies. Something like that. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-14T21:22:47-07:00","id":1149846,"title":"","content":"First thought to come to mind is a setting that emphasizes the idea of &quot;survival at any cost&quot; for Beasts. Something like a Conan-esque sword and sorcery world or Mad Max-esque post apocalyptic world.<br /> <br /> Where Beasts are either supernatural warlords that rule over various territories that encompass their Lairs, and compete with each other for Lair or for prey. With other Beasts being wandering monsters in the barren wastes in between the pockets of civilization. And occasionally forming alliance-Broods if there happen to be some Beasts living in close proximity and to share resources.<br /> <br /> With the thing they fear the most being wandering Heroes that go from place to place, that seek nothing else but to tear down the tyrannical Beasts.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-15T07:41:16-07:00","id":1149919,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1149600-storyteller\u2019s-guide-shards?p=1149846#post1149846\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">First thought to come to mind is a setting that emphasizes the idea of &quot;survival at any cost&quot; for Beasts. Something like a Conan-esque sword and sorcery world or Mad Max-esque post apocalyptic world.<br /> <br /> Where Beasts are either supernatural warlords that rule over various territories that encompass their Lairs, and compete with each other for Lair or for prey. With other Beasts being wandering monsters in the barren wastes in between the pockets of civilization. And occasionally forming alliance-Broods if there happen to be some Beasts living in close proximity and to share resources.<br /> <br /> With the thing they fear the most being wandering Heroes that go from place to place, that seek nothing else but to tear down the tyrannical Beasts.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think a Ravenloft-style one would be fitting (and similar to this). Beasts-as-Darklords would be fairly easy to pull off in all its Gothic glory.<br /> <hr /><br /> I think you could reference the group or universal aspect of the Primordial Dream for a multiversal setting as well - multiple Earths (or even other worlds) all sharing the same Primordial Dream. Explorers and Invaders from other worlds using Chambers are a means of travel... and Beasts acting as a territorial defensive system.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-15T08:27:22-07:00","id":1149930,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4418_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4418\" data-vbnamecard=\"4418\">tasti man LH</a>, just see the <b>Castelvania </b>TV series - in this scene Dracula is there perfect Beast from your's Shard idea... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hb8gv8YYs_o\" data-code=\"hb8gv8YYs_o\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/hb8gv8YYs_o/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-15T12:07:56-07:00","id":1149972,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1149600-storyteller\u2019s-guide-shards?p=1149919#post1149919\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think a Ravenloft-style one would be fitting (and similar to this). Beasts-as-Darklords would be fairly easy to pull off in all its Gothic glory.</div> </div> </div> </div>Perhaps one where the Horror is the main PC - obviously with a more complex sapience - and the Lair and Dream the main setting, while the human host and earthly world is the double-edged resource.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-15T22:31:38-07:00","id":1150077,"title":"","content":"I would adore a Shard where we go back to reincarnated monsters remembering their true selves.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-16T04:55:54-07:00","id":1150118,"title":"","content":"I think, despite Beast being the &quot;Crossover Game&quot;, a few settings that focus primarily/exclusively on Beast material and elements would enhance the game-line.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-16T07:53:45-07:00","id":1150139,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1149600-storyteller\u2019s-guide-shards?p=1150118#post1150118\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think, despite Beast being the &amp;quot;Crossover Game&amp;quot;, a few settings that focus primarily/exclusively on Beast material and elements would enhance the game-line.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm hoping that the Storytellers Guide will give us that as a basic element of the book rather than a Shard. That said, I do hope that the Shards will be Beast focused, with crossover mostly addressed through sidebars. There's a couple Shards I'd like to see personally, and a lot of the ones suggested in this thread so far would be awesome.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Jason Ross Inczauskis</b>, Freelance Writer<br /> Projects: <i>Dark Eras 2</i>, <i>Mummy: The Curse 2e, Book of Lasting Death, DtR The Clades Companion, Pirates of Pugmire,</i> <i>They Came From Beyond the Grave!, </i><i>TC Aeon: Mission Statements</i>, <i>TC In Media Res,</i> <i>DtD Night Horrors: Enemy Action,</i> <i>C20 Anthology of Dreams</i><br /> Masculine pronouns preferred.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/309-white-oak-dragon","name":"White Oak Dragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-16T08:15:23-07:00","id":1150143,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>White Oak Dragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1149600-storyteller\u2019s-guide-shards?p=1150139#post1150139\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There's a couple Shards I'd like to see personally</div> </div> </div> </div>Any specifics you'd like to share?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-16T09:59:34-07:00","id":1150167,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1149600-storyteller\u2019s-guide-shards?p=1150143#post1150143\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Any specifics you'd like to share?</div> </div> </div> </div>Okay, why not. One that I'd like to see would be more of a mythic feeling setting with more potent Beasts and more dangerous Heroes, possibly even with Beasts who could physically transform more easily. I'm still debating about whether I'd prefer such a thing to be set long ago or modern day.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Jason Ross Inczauskis</b>, Freelance Writer<br /> Projects: <i>Dark Eras 2</i>, <i>Mummy: The Curse 2e, Book of Lasting Death, DtR The Clades Companion, Pirates of Pugmire,</i> <i>They Came From Beyond the Grave!, </i><i>TC Aeon: Mission Statements</i>, <i>TC In Media Res,</i> <i>DtD Night Horrors: Enemy Action,</i> <i>C20 Anthology of Dreams</i><br /> Masculine pronouns preferred.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/309-white-oak-dragon","name":"White Oak Dragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-17T17:58:54-07:00","id":1150510,"title":"","content":"Beasts in space; are their Lairs able to cross from planet to planet, or across star systems? Are they exploited for that capability, or exploit others to grant them passage through their lairs? Do Beasts get to form Kinship with alien beings? Does the Dark Mother go from a terrestrial being to a cosmic horror all Beasts have some aspiration for?<br /> <br /> Huge stuff, but I'd like to read it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","name":"Taidragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1038"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}